# Data Model Template

Purpose:
  Template for data models and schemas.

Owns: templates\_sdd\project\data.template.sdd
Schema:
  id: SCH-XXX
  name: <schema name>
  aggregate: AGG-XXX
  owner: <team or agent>

  purpose: <one line>

  tables:
    - name: <table>
      columns: [list]
      indexes: [list]

  events:
    - EVENT-XXX

  files:
    - path/to/file

State: +
